{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：18:49 2026-08-06 HKT</p>\n\n<p>東涌東交匯處，今日（8月6日）傍晚6時許，一部巴士與一部電單車相撞，電單車倒地並被捲入巴士車底，拖行一段距離，鐵騎士重創昏迷。</p>\n<p>救援人員接報趕至，將58歲姓李男傷者救出，送北大嶼山醫院搶救。肇事60歲姓黃巴士車長雖通過酒精測試，惟涉嫌「危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害」，被警方拘捕，他現正被扣留調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"大批消防到場救援。FB：Sayali Jadhav@Tung Chung Tower Communities.\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c52621ea83fca9049c5fa3ee22136d26/2026-08/vlcsnap-2026-08-06-19h15m42s129.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場交通繁忙。FB：Sayali Jadhav@Tung Chung Tower Communities.\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a33f427096de9c449a326a236865771c/2026-08/vlcsnap-2026-08-06-19h20m29s154.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"電單車被捲入九巴車底。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/989925bfffad65fcfd34f30d6235606e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_10_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地面遺留懷疑是鐵騎士的鞋履。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5009a40554526e8ad5ec5c62d0160be4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_10_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地面遺留懷疑是鐵騎士的鞋履。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccfc27811f152ba097a51b16f5f7e549/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_10_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場所見，電單車被鍥於左邊車頭，懷疑是鐵騎士的頭盔以及波鞋散落一地，馬路遺留一段十數米白色刮痕，懷疑是電單車被拖行痕跡。另外有大批警員在場調查，肇事巴士車長則被帶上警車。</p>\n<p>目前警方仍在調查車禍原因。事故期間現場部份行車線受阻，交通繁忙，至晚上7時許解封。</p>\n<img alt=\"地面遺留電單車被拖行的刮痕。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51eec39eb679bbdd5322b100593ab0be/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_08_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地面遺留鐵騎士頭盔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45a76f1f934fedb12729a4e3bb925119/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地面遺留鐵騎士頭盔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25f9ad559ab4a63bc2c8675ed83080f5/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77cc63d432ca7f1bc5757397ddad4b2d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_10.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"涉案車長被捕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04677f2eac20bdd3504a975b662541eb/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場為東涌東交匯處。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/324c7d5129c7401580b913cd91ae9ecb/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_15_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傷者被送往北大嶼山醫院救治。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50fe074d48ca101e43c8cd90d742505c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-06_at_19_46_08.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T12:19:57.921450+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}